#. module: l10n_cssk_vies
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_vies.field_cssk_tax_authority__vies_consultation_number
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_vies.field_res_partner__vies_consultation_number
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_vies.field_res_users__vies_consultation_number
msgid ""
"Official EU VIES request identifier returned for a valid qualified check — "
"the legal proof that this VAT was confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Oficiálny identifikátor požiadavky EU VIES vrátený pri platnom "
"kvalifikovanom overení — právny dôkaz, že IČ DPH bolo potvrdené."

#. module: l10n_cssk_vies
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_cssk_vies.model_res_config_settings
msgid "Provider"
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_cssk_vies
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_cssk_vies.view_partner_form_vies
msgid ""
"The consultation number is the evidence that the check\n"
"                        happened. It is what a tax authority asks for when a\n"
"                        customer's VAT number later turns out to have been\n"
"                        invalid."
msgstr ""
"Číslo overenia je dôkazom, že overenie prebehlo. Práve ho žiada správca "
"dane, keď sa neskôr ukáže, že IČ DPH odberateľa bolo neplatné."

